## Code Example
```c
// header example
typedef struct Pipeline Pipeline;
Pipeline* pipeline_create(const char* cfg);
void pipeline_submit(Pipeline* p, const uint8_t* in, size_t len, void (*done)(const uint8_t* out, size_t out_len, void* ctx), void* ctx);
